============================================================

Components should handle:

UI
user interaction
local UI state
presentation


Components should NOT contain:

database logic
business authorization
raw endpoint construction
payment verification
secret keys


Example:

Workspace.jsx

calls:

generateCode()

not:

axios.post("/api/ai/generate-code")


