[ ] Project data comes from the backend.

[ ] Workspace files come from real data.

[ ] AI generation uses the real AI endpoint.

[ ] Deployment uses the real deployment endpoint.

[ ] Billing uses backend-confirmed subscription state.

[ ] Payment success is server verified.

[ ] Settings persist through backend APIs.

[ ] Every API operation has loading state.

[ ] Every API operation has error handling.

[ ] Empty states are intentional.

[ ] No fake project data exists.

[ ] No fake deployment data exists.

[ ] No fake billing data exists.

[ ] No fake success states exist.

[ ] Secrets are never exposed to frontend.

[ ] Project ownership is backend enforced.

[ ] Duplicate mutation requests are prevented.

[ ] API errors are normalized.

[ ] Production API configuration is centralized.

[ ] Major product areas have dedicated routes.

